- HTTP (port 80): Connection REFUSED — port not accepting connections at all
- HTTPS (port 443): Connection REFUSED — port not accepting connections at all

Note the discrepancy: Uni gets TCP connections accepted with 503 responses, while I get outright connection refusals. This could indicate source-based filtering on ACM's side, or the service may have degraded further since Uni's test.

